          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’re proud to be doing our very best every day to produce products that make raising the future generation easier, while also being safe and gentle for little humans and the planet they’ll inherit someday. That means being mindful of the materials we use. Read on for everything you need to know about one of our all-time favourite materials: TENCEL™ Lyocell.</p>",
