            "title": "It’s unbelievably soft",
            "text": "<p>TENCEL fibres are naturally soft and smooth (some say even softer than silk!), making for the perfect fabric for delicate and sensitive baby skin. The softness is a super power for preventing irritation and maximizing comfort. </p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": ""
